      "content": "SP 90 SW                  CHARTRIDGE \t        ASHERIDGE                                                  (west side ) 5/4                                             Tiles Farm House - GV\t\t\t\t\t        II \t\t\t\t\t\t\t                       House.  C17 altered and extended.  Timber framed, with modern brick ground floor and infill.  Flint and brick gable wall.  Old tile roof, higher over C18 bay on left, with chimney at junction, dentil brick eaves to higher part.  Two 3-light casements to ground floor, 3 to first floor.  Single storey gabled wing in centre.  2-storey rear wing with flint and brick flank wall to road.  Timber framing exposed in rear wall. Listing NGR: SP9423904077"
    }
